---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About Kaine Cohen — CohenHolmes"
  description="Who's behind CohenHolmes — not a CV, just who I actually am, what I'm into, and the tools and writing built along the way."
  canonicalPath="/about"
>
  <meta slot="head" http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; connect-src 'self' https://cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'">

  <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
  <h1>The person behind CohenHolmes</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    Not a CV — that's what LinkedIn is for. Just who I actually am.
  </p>

  <section class="block">
    <h2>Who I am</h2>
    <p>
      I'm Kaine. I'm based in the UK — I'll leave it vaguer than that on purpose.
    </p>
    <p>
      Technology is a genuine fascination for me, not just a job. How you secure an
      application, how you manage an environment properly, and how all of that has to keep
      adapting as something like AI reshapes the processes underneath it — that shift has had
      a real impact on how I think, not just how I work.
    </p>
    <p>
      I'm a serious AI enthusiast, and not only as a chat assistant. What interests me more is
      AI as something that blends, creates and manipulates — this site is a good example. It's
      built on Astro, and honestly I don't know the framework inside out. What I do know is how
      to sit down with Claude, have a proper back-and-forth, and work out how to actually stand
      something up.
    </p>
    <p>
      Outside of all that: I run twice a week, and I'm in the gym twice a week too. I'm a
      massive foodie — I love trying new food, and the best thing I've eaten recently was
      Turkish lamb chops, quite possibly the best lamb chops of my life.
    </p>
    <p>
      I've also got a dog, Dora — calm, relaxing, full of adventure, and owner of far too many
      toys. And then there's Charley, the love of my life.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <h2>What I've built</h2>
    <p>
      The same instinct each time: build the thing I wanted to exist while I was working
      something out myself.
    </p>
    <div class="grid">
      <a class="card" href="/ca-builder">
        <div class="kicker">Tooling</div>
        <p>An interactive Conditional Access Policy Builder — plain-English input, live Microsoft Graph-style JSON out.</p>
        <span class="more">Open the builder →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/ai-governance-check">
        <div class="kicker">AI Governance</div>
        <p>A private, browser-only readiness check across data, identity, governance, agents and human oversight.</p>
        <span class="more">Check your readiness →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/mcp">
        <div class="kicker">For agents</div>
        <p>A read-only MCP server exposing this blog to any AI agent — list posts, fetch the latest, read one in full.</p>
        <span class="more">Connect your agent →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/blog">
        <div class="kicker">Writing</div>
        <p>Personal notes on identity, security, AI and technology — usually working something out in public.</p>
        <span class="more">Read the blog →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block" id="contact">
    <h2>Say hello</h2>
    <p>
      Happy to talk identity, security, compliance, or where AI fits into any of them — or about
      any of the above.
    </p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button primary" href="https://linkedin.com/in/kainecohen" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn ↗</a>
      <a class="button" href="mailto:kaine.cohen@cohenholmes.co.uk">Email</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .eyebrow{
    margin:0 0 16px;
    font-family:var(--font-mono);
    font-size:0.76rem;
    letter-spacing:0.12em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--accent-text);
  }
  .lede{
    max-width:70ch;
    margin-top:18px;
    font-size:clamp(1.02rem, 1.6vw, 1.18rem);
    color:#4A4A5A;
  }

  .block{ margin-top:56px; }
  .block > p{ max-width:68ch; }

  .grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap:18px;
    margin-top:22px;
  }
  .card{
    background:#FCFAF6;
    border:1px solid #E3DFD3;
    border-radius:16px;
    padding:22px 20px;
    box-shadow:0 8px 18px rgba(15,30,51,0.06);
    text-decoration:none;
    transition:transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .card:hover{ transform:translateY(-2px); border-color:var(--accent); }
  .card:focus-visible{ outline:2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset:2px; }
  .card .kicker{
    font-family:var(--font-body);
    color:var(--accent-text);
    font-weight:500;
    font-size:0.72rem;
    letter-spacing:0.11em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    margin-bottom:10px;
  }
  .card p{ margin:0; color:#4A4A5A; font-size:0.95rem; }
  .card .more{
    display:inline-block;
    margin-top:10px;
    font-size:0.85rem;
    color:var(--navy);
  }

  .actions{
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:12px;
    margin-top:22px;
  }
  .button{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
    padding:11px 18px;
    text-decoration:none;
    border-radius:100px;
    font-size:0.95rem;
    font-weight:500;
    border:1px solid #E3DFD3;
    background:var(--cream);
    color:var(--navy);
    transition:transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
  }
  .button:hover{ transform:translateY(-1px); border-color:var(--accent); background:#F1E2D6; }
  .button.primary{
    background:var(--navy);
    color:var(--cream);
    border-color:var(--navy);
  }
  .button.primary:hover{ background:var(--accent-text); border-color:var(--accent-text); color:#fff; }
  .button:focus-visible{ outline:2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset:2px; }
</style>
